			"notes": "## Minehop Meteor Addon v1.2.2\n\n### Build updates\n- Bumped Minecraft target to 1.21.11.\n- Updated Yarn mappings to 1.21.11+build.4.\n- Updated Meteor dependency to 1.21.11-SNAPSHOT (resolved build 65).\n- Updated Fabric Loader to 0.18.4 and Fabric API to 0.141.3+1.21.11.\n- added custom icon to mod settings.\n\n### Dependency cleanup\n- Removed Cloth Config / AutoConfig dependency from the addon runtime path.\n- Config now uses the addon’s lightweight internal in-memory config model.\n\n### Artifacts\n- minehop-meteor-1.2.2.jar\n- minehop-meteor-latest.jar"
